{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/url\/template"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Template","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV8TemplateV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Template","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false}],"extendedModule":"FoundationEssentials","title":"URL.Template"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Creating a template","anchor":"Creating-a-template","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/init(_:)"]},{"title":"Supporting types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/Value","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/VariableName"],"anchor":"Supporting-types"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Creating a URL from a template","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/init(template:variables:)"],"anchor":"Creating-a-URL-from-a-template"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A template for constructing a URL from variable expansions."}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SQ","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SH","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Template"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is an template that can be expanded into"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" by calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URL(template:variables:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Templating has a rich set of options for substituting various parts of URLs. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/datatracker.ietf.org\/doc\/html\/rfc6570","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"details."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Example 1","anchor":"Example-1"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let template = URL.Template(\"http:\/\/www.example.com\/foo{?query,number}\")!","let url = URL(","    template: template,","    variables: [","        .query: \"bar baz\",","        .number: \"234\",","    ]",")","","extension URL.Template.VariableName {","    static var query: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"query\") }","    static var number: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"number\") }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The resulting URL will be"}]},{"syntax":"text","type":"codeListing","code":["http:\/\/www.example.com\/foo?query=bar%20baz&number=234"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Usage","anchor":"Usage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Templates provide a description of a URL space and define how URLs can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be constructed given specific variable values. Their intended use is,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for example, to allow a server to communicate to a client how to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"construct URLs for particular resources."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For each specific resource, an API contract is required to clearly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"define the variables applicable to that resource and its associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"template. For example, such an API contract might specify that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"variable "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"query"},{"type":"text","text":" is mandatory and must be an alphanumeric string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the variable "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"number"},{"type":"text","text":" is optional and must be a positive integer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if provided. The server could then provide the client with a template"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"http:\/\/www.example.com\/foo{?query,number}"},{"type":"text","text":", which the client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can subsequently use to substitute variables accordingly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An API contract is necessary to define which substitutions are valid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within a given URL space. There is no guarantee that every possible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expansion of variable expressions corresponds to an existing resource"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URL; indeed, some expansions may not even produce a valid URL. Only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the API specification itself can determine which expansions are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expected to yield valid URLs corresponding to existing resources."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Example 2","anchor":"Example-2"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here’s an example, that illustrates how to define a specific set of variables:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct MyQueryTemplate: Sendable, Hashable {","    var template: URL.Template","","    init?(_ template: String) {","        guard let t = URL.Template(template) else { return nil }","        self.template = t","    }","}","","struct MyQuery: Sendable, Hashable {","    var query: String","    var number: Int?","","    var variables: [URL.Template.VariableName: URL.Template.Value] {","        var result: [URL.Template.VariableName: URL.Template.Value] = [","            .query: .text(query)","        ]","        if let number {","            result[.number] = .text(\"\\(number)\")","        }","        return result","    }","}","","extension URL.Template.VariableName {","    static var query: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"query\") }","    static var number: URL.Template.VariableName { .init(\"number\") }","}","","extension URL {","    init?(","        template: MyQueryTemplate,","        query: MyQuery","    ) {","        self.init(","            template: template.template,","            variables: query.variables","        )","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8SendableP"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/s23CustomStringConvertibleP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.CustomStringConvertible","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/URL/Template/init(_:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"?(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a new template from its text form."}],"url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/url\/template\/init(_:)","title":"init(_:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/init(_:)"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/URL/Template/Equatable-Implementations":{"role":"collectionGroup","kind":"article","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/url\/template\/equatable-implementations","title":"Equatable Implementations","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URL\/Template\/Equatable-